                <pb facs="0254" n="244" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv10/pg244"/>

                <head>Appendix 131</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Report by the Committee of the Ram
                        Materials Section on War Stocks</hi></p>
                <p>The Raw Material Section, in submitting the annexed report<anchor n="*"
                        xml:id="d15-f1"/> to the Supreme Economic Council, desire to represent the
                    extreme urgency of supplying raw materials to the countries named therein.
                    Without the supply of raw materials there is no hope for the peace of Europe.
                    The Section therefore recommends that the matter should be immediately laid
                    before the Council of the Heads of Governments with a request that they will
                    give such directions to the Financial Authorities of the Associated Governments
                    as will make possible a solution of this question.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
